{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Alchemortis</i>\u00a0is a dark fantasy roguelite autobattler built on grid-based inventory management. Battles are determined by the placement of cards, with card positioning determining attack patterns and build synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs are driven by alchemy, with cards alchemized into new forms that create unexpected strategies and powerful builds each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world of alchemy, necromancy, and medieval science, <i>Alchemortis</i> combines strategic depth with roguelite replayability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Autobattler combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategy is decided before the fight, then carried out on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/e8843626bed0f781a1995c2036debc2a.poster.avif?t=1758547172\" width=1170 height=690 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/e8843626bed0f781a1995c2036debc2a.webm?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/e8843626bed0f781a1995c2036debc2a.mp4?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Strategic Grid-based inventory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Card placement determines attack patterns and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/307075e024567fe7072a3812fdb406bb.poster.avif?t=1758547172\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/307075e024567fe7072a3812fdb406bb.webm?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/307075e024567fe7072a3812fdb406bb.mp4?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Alchemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Engage in the forbidden science of alchemy to mutate cards into new forms, unlocking new strategies and creating unique builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/cf887e76980cca362156edd821ab2a4d.poster.avif?t=1758547172\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/cf887e76980cca362156edd821ab2a4d.webm?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/cf887e76980cca362156edd821ab2a4d.mp4?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the map, gathering dark power while gaining notoriety. Gain too much notoriety, and you're thrust into a life-or-death boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/816cada274b053b0c16fef7a446e858a.poster.avif?t=1758547172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/816cada274b053b0c16fef7a446e858a.webm?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/816cada274b053b0c16fef7a446e858a.mp4?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Varied arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From necromantic minions to weapons and relics, cards have their own unique capabilities and strategic value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/90c1330a14f6d40d024bf2ec37c764c8.poster.avif?t=1758547172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/90c1330a14f6d40d024bf2ec37c764c8.webm?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/90c1330a14f6d40d024bf2ec37c764c8.mp4?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Roguelite replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experiment with countless combinations and discover new builds each run. Chase the perfect build, or make do with what you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/a77a472f52aeb99c18f7a4263e6563d7.poster.avif?t=1758547172\" width=1170 height=828 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/a77a472f52aeb99c18f7a4263e6563d7.webm?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/a77a472f52aeb99c18f7a4263e6563d7.mp4?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967230?t=1758547172","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967230?t=1758547172","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/537457a2698531072009b29042beb244472895c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758547172","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/537457a2698531072009b29042beb244472895c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758547172","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Alchemortis</i>\u00a0is a dark fantasy roguelite autobattler built on grid-based inventory management. Battles are determined by the placement of cards, with card positioning determining attack patterns and build synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs are driven by alchemy, with cards alchemized into new forms that create unexpected strategies and powerful builds each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world of alchemy, necromancy, and medieval science, <i>Alchemortis</i> combines strategic depth with roguelite replayability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Autobattler combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategy is decided before the fight, then carried out on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/e8843626bed0f781a1995c2036debc2a.poster.avif?t=1758547172\" width=1170 height=690 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst