pps/3967230/extras/cf887e76980cca362156edd821ab2a4d.mp4?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the map, gathering dark power while gaining notoriety. Gain too much notoriety, and you're thrust into a life-or-death boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/816cada274b053b0c16fef7a446e858a.poster.avif?t=1758547172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/816cada274b053b0c16fef7a446e858a.webm?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/816cada274b053b0c16fef7a446e858a.mp4?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Varied arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From necromantic minions to weapons and relics, cards have their own unique capabilities and strategic value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/90c1330a14f6d40d024bf2ec37c764c8.poster.avif?t=1758547172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/90c1330a14f6d40d024bf2ec37c764c8.webm?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/90c1330a14f6d40d024bf2ec37c764c8.mp4?t=1758547172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"